    "limits": [
      "A LOCAL_REPLICATION of the hosted workflow's steps under the workflow's pinned Node major, not a hosted CI run: the account's GitHub Actions admission is closed by a billing lock, so the wired CI steps are PUBLISHED but have NOT run there, and no hosted result is claimed here.",
      "No independent HUMAN approval is claimed: the verification is tool-based (suites, mutation probes, a self-validating run record) and the independent qualification of the source security gate of 2026-10-21 was performed by a reviewer agent, not by a human owner.",
      "The cleanup boundary covers the HARNESS SURFACE (the tools under scripts/tools/ and their tests under tests/tools/). The product feature tests and the closed S5/S8/S9 lane tests still remove their own scratch trees directly; they are REPORTED by the guard and are NOT converted, because this bounded run does not re-open those lanes.",
      "The content check of the persisted evidence covers the assurance closure run of 2026-10-21. It checks what the evidence SAYS; it does not re-verify the gates themselves, and it is not a semantic analysis of the evidence.",
